    "text": "$\\tan \\left[\\frac{\\pi}{4}+\\frac{1}{2} \\cos ^{-1}\\left(\\frac{a}{b}\\right)\\right]+\\tan \\left[\\frac{\\pi}{4}-\\frac{1}{2} \\cos ^{-1}\\left(\\frac{a}{b}\\right)\\right]$ is equal to"
